#: admin/settings.php:275
msgid ""
"Configure your GDPR/ePrivacy and Google Consent Mode v2 cookie banner. This "
"plugin helps with compliance but does not constitute legal advice."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurer dit cookiebanner til GDPR/ePrivacy og Google Consent Mode v2. "
"Dette plugin hjælper med regeloverholdelse, men udgør ikke juridisk "
"rådgivning."

#: admin/settings.php:293
msgid "Live preview (updates as you change Design and General settings):"
msgstr ""
"Forhåndsvisning i realtid (opdateres, når du ændrer indstillingerne for "
"Design og Generelt):"

#: admin/settings.php:295
msgid "Preview device width"
msgstr "Enhedsbredde for forhåndsvisning"

#: admin/settings.php:296 admin/settings.php:298 admin/statistics-tab.php:67
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Desktop"

#: admin/settings.php:300 admin/settings.php:302 admin/statistics-tab.php:68
msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Tablet"

#: admin/settings.php:304 admin/settings.php:306 admin/statistics-tab.php:69
msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "Mobil"

#: admin/settings.php:330 includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:531
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Tilgængelighed"

#: admin/settings.php:344
msgid "Consent mode"
msgstr "Samtykketilstand"

#: admin/settings.php:349
msgid "Auto by region (EU opt-in, US opt-out, rest by choice)"
msgstr ""
"Automatisk efter region (EU: tilvalg, USA: fravalg, resten efter valg)"

#: admin/settings.php:350
msgid "Opt-in everywhere (GDPR — safest)"
msgstr "Opt-in overalt (GDPR – sikrest)"

#: admin/settings.php:351
msgid "Opt-out everywhere (CCPA style)"
msgstr "Opt-out overalt (CCPA-stil)"

#: admin/settings.php:352 admin/settings.php:958
msgid "Notice only"
msgstr "Kun meddelelse"

#: admin/settings.php:359
msgid ""
"Region is detected from CDN/edge headers (e.g. Cloudflare). When unknown, "
"the safest opt-in model is used. No external geolocation API is called."
msgstr ""
"Regionen registreres ud fra CDN-/edge-headere (f.eks. Cloudflare). Når den "
"er ukendt, bruges den sikreste opt-in-model. Der kaldes ingen ekstern "
"geolokaliserings-API."

#: admin/settings.php:363
msgid "Privacy/Cookie policy URL"
msgstr "URL til privatlivs-/cookiepolitik"

#: admin/settings.php:372 includes/languages.php:283
msgid "Banner title"
msgstr "Bannertitel"

#: admin/settings.php:378
msgid "Leave empty to use the translated default."
msgstr "Lad feltet være tomt for at bruge den oversatte standardværdi."

#: admin/settings.php:382 includes/languages.php:287
msgid "Banner description"
msgstr "Bannerbeskrivelse"

#: admin/settings.php:387
msgid ""
"Basic HTML allowed: links, bold, italic, line breaks. Leave empty for the "
"translated default."
msgstr ""
"Grundlæggende HTML er tilladt: links, fed skrift, kursiv og linjeskift. Lad "
"feltet være tomt for at bruge den oversatte standardtekst."

#: admin/settings.php:391 admin/settings.php:1029
msgid "Policy version"
msgstr "Politikversion"

#: admin/settings.php:396
msgid ""
"Increase this number whenever your cookie policy changes. Visitors will be "
"asked to consent again."
msgstr ""
"Øg dette tal, hver gang din cookiepolitik ændres. Besøgende bliver bedt om "
"at give samtykke igen."

#: admin/settings.php:400
msgid "Exclude pages/posts"
msgstr "Udelad sider/indlæg"

#: admin/settings.php:406
msgid ""
"Comma-separated page/post IDs where the banner should not be shown (e.g. "
"landing pages)."
msgstr ""
"Kommaseparerede side-/indlægs-ID'er, hvor banneret ikke skal vises (f.eks. "
"landingssider)."

#: admin/settings.php:414
msgid "Anonymous statistics"
msgstr "Anonyme statistikker"

#: admin/settings.php:420
msgid ""
"Collect anonymous statistics (how many visitors accept, reject or open "
"preferences). Fully aggregated and cookieless — no IP address or personal "
"data is stored. Shown in the Statistics tab."
msgstr ""
"Indsaml anonym statistik (hvor mange besøgende der accepterer, afviser eller"
" åbner præferencer). Helt aggregeret og uden cookies – ingen IP-adresse "
"eller personoplysninger gemmes. Vises under fanen Statistik."

#: admin/settings.php:425
msgid "Benchmark sharing"
msgstr "Benchmark-deling"

#: admin/settings.php:430
msgid ""
"Share anonymous statistics to help improve the plugin — and see how your "
"accept rate compares to the average. Off by default. Sends only aggregated "
"numbers and your site domain (never visitor IPs) to the Lynbro portal, once "
"a week."
msgstr ""
"Del anonyme statistikker for at hjælpe med at forbedre pluginet – og se, "
"hvordan din acceptprocent ligger i forhold til gennemsnittet. Slået fra som "
"standard. Sender kun aggregerede tal og dit websteds domæne (aldrig "
"besøgendes IP-adresser) til Lynbro-portalen én gang om ugen."

#: admin/settings.php:442
msgid "Design presets"
msgstr "Designforvalg"

#: admin/settings.php:443
msgid ""
"One-click starting points. Applying a preset fills the Design fields below "
"and updates the live preview — review it, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Udgangspunkter med ét klik. Når du anvender en forudindstilling, udfyldes "
"felterne under Design nedenfor, og den direkte forhåndsvisning opdateres – "
"gennemgå den, og vælg derefter Gem ændringer for at beholde den."

#: admin/settings.php:455 admin/settings.php:611
msgid "Position"
msgstr "Placering"

#: admin/settings.php:460
msgid "Bottom bar"
msgstr "Bundbjælke"

#: admin/settings.php:461
msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Topbjælke"

#: admin/settings.php:462
msgid "Floating box (corner)"
msgstr "Flydende boks (hjørne)"

#: admin/settings.php:463
msgid "Center modal (with overlay)"
msgstr "Centreret modalvindue (med overlejring)"

#: admin/settings.php:473
msgid "Box corner"
msgstr "Hjørneboks"

#: admin/settings.php:478 admin/settings.php:616
msgid "Bottom right"
msgstr "Nederst til højre"

#: admin/settings.php:479 admin/settings.php:617
msgid "Bottom left"
msgstr "Nederst til venstre"

#: admin/settings.php:480 admin/settings.php:618
msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Øverst til højre"

#: admin/settings.php:481 admin/settings.php:619
msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Øverst til venstre"

#: admin/settings.php:488
msgid "Used only when Position is \"Floating box\"."
msgstr "Bruges kun, når placeringen er “Flydende boks”."

#: admin/settings.php:492
msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Tema"

#: admin/settings.php:497
msgid "Light"
msgstr "Lys"

#: admin/settings.php:498
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "Mørk"

#: admin/settings.php:499
msgid "Auto (follow visitor’s system)"
msgstr "Automatisk (følger den besøgendes system)"

#: admin/settings.php:506
msgid ""
"Auto uses the light colors by default and the dark colors when the visitor’s"
" device prefers a dark color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Automatisk bruger som standard de lyse farver og skifter til de mørke "
"farver, når den besøgendes enhed foretrækker et mørkt farveskema."

#: admin/settings.php:510
msgid "Banner max width (px)"
msgstr "Bannerets maksimale bredde (px)"

#: admin/settings.php:515
msgid ""
"Maximum width of the floating box and center modal. Set 0 to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Maksimal bredde på den flydende boks og den centrerede modal. Angiv 0 for at"
" bruge standardværdien."

#: admin/settings.php:519
msgid "Corner radius (px)"
msgstr "Hjørneradius (px)"

#: admin/settings.php:524
msgid ""
"Rounding of the banner, box and modal corners. Set 0 to use the default."
msgstr ""
"Afrunding af hjørner på banner, boks og modalvindue. Angiv 0 for at bruge "
"standardværdien."

#: admin/settings.php:528
msgid "Edge offset (px)"
msgstr "Afstand fra kant (px)"

#: admin/settings.php:533
msgid "Gap from the screen edges for the floating box layout."
msgstr "Afstand til skærmens kanter for layoutet med flydende boks."

#: admin/settings.php:537
msgid "Stacking (z-index base)"
msgstr "Lagdeling (basis for z-index)"

#: admin/settings.php:542
msgid ""
"Base z-index for the banner, overlay, modal and floating button. Increase it"
" if another element covers the banner; lower it if the banner covers "
"something it should not."
msgstr ""
"Basis-z-index for banneret, overlayet, modalvinduet og den flydende knap. "
"Forøg værdien, hvis et andet element dækker banneret; sænk den, hvis "
"banneret dækker noget, det ikke bør."

#: admin/settings.php:547
msgid "Light colors"
msgstr "Lyse farver"

#: admin/settings.php:551 admin/settings.php:576
msgid "Banner background"
msgstr "Bannerets baggrund"

#: admin/settings.php:552 admin/settings.php:577
msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Tekstfarve"

#: admin/settings.php:553 admin/settings.php:578 includes/languages.php:291
msgid "Accept button"
msgstr "Accepter-knap"

#: admin/settings.php:554 admin/settings.php:579 includes/languages.php:295
msgid "Reject button"
msgstr "Afvis-knap"

#: admin/settings.php:555 admin/settings.php:580
msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Knaptekst"

#: admin/settings.php:572
msgid "Dark colors"
msgstr "Mørke farver"

#: admin/settings.php:597
msgid "Floating settings button"
msgstr "Flydende indstillingsknap"

#: admin/settings.php:598
msgid ""
"A small icon-only button that lets visitors reopen the cookie settings after"
" they have made a choice. It is automatically hidden while the banner or "
"preferences dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"En lille knap kun med ikon, som besøgende kan bruge til at åbne "
"cookieindstillingerne igen, efter at de har truffet et valg. Den skjules "
"automatisk, mens banneret eller præferencedialogen er åben."

#: admin/settings.php:601
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Synlighed"

#: admin/settings.php:605
msgid "Show floating settings button on the site"
msgstr "Vis en flydende indstillingsknap på webstedet"

#: admin/settings.php:607
msgid ""
"Unchecking this hides the floating button completely — visitors will not see"
" a way to reopen their cookie settings (unless you add the "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] shortcode somewhere)."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du fjerner markeringen, skjules den flydende knap helt – besøgende vil "
"ikke kunne se en måde at åbne deres cookieindstillinger igen på (medmindre "
"du tilføjer kortkoden [lynbro_cookie_settings] et sted)."

#: admin/settings.php:629
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Form"

#: admin/settings.php:634
msgid "Round"
msgstr "Rund"

#: admin/settings.php:635
msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Afrundet"

