msgstr "Lad feltet være tomt for at bruge farven på knapteksten."

#: admin/settings.php:690
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opacitet"

#: admin/settings.php:695
msgid ""
"Resting transparency (0.2–1.0). The button becomes fully opaque on hover or "
"focus. Default is 0.55."
msgstr ""
"Transparens i hviletilstand (0,2–1,0). Knappen bliver helt uigennemsigtig, "
"når markøren holdes over den, eller når den er i fokus. Standard er 0,55."

#: admin/settings.php:699
msgid "Accessible label"
msgstr "Tilgængelighedsetiket"

#: admin/settings.php:705
msgid ""
"Used as the tooltip and screen-reader label. Leave empty for the translated "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Bruges som værktøjstip og skærmlæseretiket. Lad feltet stå tomt for den "
"oversatte standardværdi."

#: admin/settings.php:709
msgid "Icon"
msgstr "Ikon"

#: admin/settings.php:713
msgid ""
"Show the cookie icon (recommended). When off, the accessible label is shown "
"as a small text button instead."
msgstr ""
"Vis cookieikonet (anbefales). Når det er slået fra, vises "
"tilgængelighedsetiketten i stedet som en lille tekstknap."

#: admin/settings.php:722
msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are always active and cannot be disabled. Choose which "
"optional categories visitors can control."
msgstr ""
"Nødvendige cookies er altid aktive og kan ikke deaktiveres. Vælg, hvilke "
"valgfrie kategorier besøgende kan styre."

#: admin/settings.php:731 includes/languages.php:310 public/banner.php:481
msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Altid aktiv"

#: admin/settings.php:739
msgid "Enable this category"
msgstr "Aktiver denne kategori"

#: admin/settings.php:753
msgid "Automatic tracker blocking"
msgstr "Automatisk blokering af trackere"

#: admin/settings.php:757
msgid ""
"Automatically block known third-party trackers (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, and more) until the matching category is granted."
msgstr ""
"Bloker automatisk kendte tredjepartstrackere (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity og flere), indtil der er givet samtykke til den "
"tilhørende kategori."

#: admin/settings.php:759
msgid ""
"This complements manual script marking. All detection is local; no external "
"request is made."
msgstr ""
"Dette supplerer manuel markering af scripts. Al registrering sker lokalt; "
"der foretages ingen eksterne anmodninger."

#: admin/settings.php:763
msgid "Emoji images from WordPress.org"
msgstr "Emoji-billeder fra WordPress.org"

#: admin/settings.php:767
msgid ""
"Do not load emoji images from WordPress.org; visitors see emoji in their own"
" device font."
msgstr ""
"Indlæs ikke emoji-billeder fra WordPress.org; besøgende ser emoji i "
"skrifttypen på deres egen enhed."

#: admin/settings.php:769
msgid ""
"WordPress swaps emoji for images hosted on WordPress.org in browsers without"
" an emoji font, which sends the visitor's IP address to WordPress.org before"
" any consent. On by default; the admin and the editor are not affected."
msgstr ""
"WordPress erstatter emoji med billeder fra WordPress.org i browsere uden en "
"emoji-skrifttype, hvilket sender den besøgendes IP-adresse til "
"WordPress.org, før der er givet samtykke. Slået til som standard; "
"administrationen og editoren påvirkes ikke."

#: admin/settings.php:773
msgid "Embed placeholders"
msgstr "Pladsholdere til indlejringer"

#: admin/settings.php:777
msgid ""
"Block embedded content (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, social embeds, "
"reCAPTCHA, and more) until consent, showing a tidy placeholder with an "
"\"allow\" button."
msgstr ""
"Blokér indlejret indhold (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, indlejringer fra "
"sociale medier, reCAPTCHA m.m.), indtil der er givet samtykke, og vis en pæn"
" pladsholder med en \"Tillad\"-knap."

#: admin/settings.php:782
msgid "Embed consent category"
msgstr "Samtykkekategori for indlejringer"

#: admin/settings.php:794
msgid ""
"Embeds are unblocked when the visitor grants this category (or clicks "
"\"allow\" on the placeholder)."
msgstr ""
"Indlejringer låses op, når den besøgende giver samtykke til denne kategori "
"(eller klikker på \"tillad\" på pladsholderen)."

#: admin/settings.php:799
msgid "You can still block your own scripts manually:"
msgstr "Du kan stadig blokere dine egne scripts manuelt:"

#: admin/settings.php:808
msgid "Google Consent Mode v2"
msgstr "Google Consent Mode v2"

#: admin/settings.php:812
msgid "Enable Google Consent Mode v2 signals"
msgstr "Aktiver signaler for Google Consent Mode v2"

#: admin/settings.php:815
msgid ""
"Sets all consent signals to \"denied\" by default before consent, then "
"updates them based on the visitor’s choice (ad_storage, analytics_storage, "
"ad_user_data, ad_personalization, functionality_storage, "
"personalization_storage, security_storage)."
msgstr ""
"Indstiller som standard alle samtykkesignaler til \"afvist\", før der er "
"givet samtykke, og opdaterer dem derefter ud fra den besøgendes valg "
"(ad_storage, analytics_storage, ad_user_data, ad_personalization, "
"functionality_storage, personalization_storage, security_storage)."

#: admin/settings.php:820
msgid "Global Privacy Control (GPC)"
msgstr "Global Privacy Control (GPC)"

#: admin/settings.php:824
msgid ""
"Honor the browser Global Privacy Control signal. In opt-out (US/CCPA) mode, "
"visitors with GPC are automatically opted out and shown a visible "
"confirmation (required by California from 2026)."
msgstr ""
"Respekter browserens Global Privacy Control-signal. I opt-out-tilstand "
"(US/CCPA) bliver besøgende med GPC automatisk frameldt og får vist en synlig"
" bekræftelse (krævet af Californien fra 2026)."

#: admin/settings.php:829
msgid "CCPA / CPRA opt-out link"
msgstr "CCPA-/CPRA-fravalgslink"

#: admin/settings.php:833
msgid ""
"Show a \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in opt-out "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Vis et link til \"Sælg eller del ikke mine personoplysninger\" i "
"fravalgstilstand."

#: admin/settings.php:838
msgid "WP Consent API"
msgstr "WP Consent API"

#: admin/settings.php:842
msgid ""
"Register as the consent provider for the WP Consent API plugin and notify "
"other plugins of the visitor’s choice (functional, preferences, statistics, "
"marketing)."
msgstr ""
"Registrer pluginet som samtykkeudbyder for WP Consent API-pluginet, og "
"underret andre plugins om den besøgendes valg (funktionelle, præferencer, "
"statistik, markedsføring)."

#: admin/settings.php:859
msgid "Local consent log"
msgstr "Lokal samtykkelog"

#: admin/settings.php:863
msgid ""
"Store a privacy-respecting proof of consent in your own database. No raw IP "
"address is stored — only a salted, anonymised hash for de-duplication."
msgstr ""
"Gem privatlivsvenlig dokumentation for samtykke i din egen database. Der "
"gemmes ingen rå IP-adresse – kun en saltet, anonymiseret hashværdi for at "
"undgå dubletter."

#: admin/settings.php:868
msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Opbevaringsperiode (dage)"

#: admin/settings.php:873
msgid ""
"Records older than this are deleted automatically. Set to 0 to keep records "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Registreringer, der er ældre end dette, slettes automatisk. Sæt til 0 for at"
" gemme registreringer på ubestemt tid."

