msgstr "webstedet er sat op til Danmark"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1426
msgid "comments are open"
msgstr "kommentarer er åbne"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1427
msgid "tracking tags are active"
msgstr "sporingstags er aktive"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1428
msgid "visitors can create accounts"
msgstr "besøgende kan oprette konti"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1437
msgid "Suggested because %l."
msgstr "Foreslået, fordi %l."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1491
#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1522
msgid "Suggested for this site"
msgstr "Forslag til dette websted"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1492
msgid "Hide suggestions"
msgstr "Skjul forslag"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1494
msgid ""
"Other Lynbro plugins that fit what this site uses. Nothing is installed "
"unless you click."
msgstr ""
"Andre Lynbro-plugins, der passer til det, webstedet bruger. Intet "
"installeres, medmindre du klikker."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1495
msgid "All Lynbro plugins"
msgstr "Alle Lynbro-plugins"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1523
msgid ""
"Picked from what this site already uses — read on this site, nothing is sent"
" anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Udvalgt ud fra det, webstedet allerede bruger – læst her på webstedet, intet"
" sendes nogen steder hen."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1643
msgid ""
"Export this plugin&#8217;s settings as a JSON backup, or reset them to "
"defaults. 100% local — nothing leaves your site."
msgstr ""
"Eksportér dette plugins indstillinger som en JSON-sikkerhedskopi, eller "
"nulstil dem til standardindstillinger. 100% lokalt – intet forlader dit "
"websted."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1651
msgid "Reset all settings to defaults?"
msgstr "Nulstil alle indstillinger til standardindstillinger?"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:1655
msgid "Reset to defaults"
msgstr "Nulstil til standardindstillinger"

#: includes/onboarding.php:30
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Indstillinger"

#: includes/onboarding.php:110
msgid ""
"Enjoying Lynbro Cookie Consent? A short, honest review helps other site "
"owners find it. No pressure — only if you have a minute."
msgstr ""
"Synes du godt om Lynbro Cookie Consent? En kort, ærlig anmeldelse hjælper "
"andre webstedsejere med at finde det. Intet pres – kun hvis du har et minut."

#: includes/onboarding.php:117
msgid "No thanks, don’t show this again"
msgstr "Nej tak, vis ikke dette igen"

#: includes/options.php:60
msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Nødvendige"

#: includes/options.php:61
msgid ""
"Required for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are "
"usually set in response to actions you make, such as setting privacy "
"preferences or logging in."
msgstr ""
"De er nødvendige for, at webstedet kan fungere, og kan ikke slås fra. De "
"sættes normalt som reaktion på handlinger, du foretager, f.eks. når du "
"angiver privatlivsindstillinger eller logger ind."

#: includes/options.php:66
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Præferencer"

#: includes/options.php:67
msgid ""
"Allow the website to remember choices you make (such as language or region) "
"to provide enhanced, personalized features."
msgstr ""
"Tillad webstedet at huske de valg, du foretager (f.eks. sprog eller region),"
" for at kunne tilbyde forbedrede, personligt tilpassede funktioner."

#: includes/options.php:73
msgid ""
"Help us understand how visitors interact with the website by collecting and "
"reporting information anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Hjælp os med at forstå, hvordan besøgende interagerer med webstedet ved at "
"indsamle og rapportere oplysninger anonymt."

#: includes/options.php:78
msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Markedsføring"

#: includes/options.php:79
msgid ""
"Used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertising and "
"measure campaign effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Bruges til at spore besøgende på tværs af websteder for at vise relevante "
"annoncer og måle kampagners effektivitet."

#: includes/options.php:252
msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Vi værner om dit privatliv"

#: includes/options.php:265
msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized "
"content and analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies, reject non-"
"essential ones, or manage your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Vi bruger cookies til at forbedre din browsingoplevelse, vise personligt "
"tilpasset indhold og analysere vores trafik. Du kan acceptere alle cookies, "
"afvise ikke-nødvendige cookies eller administrere dine præferencer."

#: includes/options.php:500 includes/shortcode.php:32
msgid "Cookie settings"
msgstr "Cookieindstillinger"

#: includes/stats.php:151
msgid "Statistics are disabled."
msgstr "Statistik er deaktiveret."

#: includes/telemetry.php:65
msgid "Once Weekly"
msgstr "Én gang om ugen"

#: public/banner.php:111
msgid ""
"We detected a Global Privacy Control signal and automatically opted you out "
"of non-essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Vi registrerede et Global Privacy Control-signal og fravalgte automatisk "
"ikke-nødvendige cookies for dig."

#: public/banner.php:112 public/banner.php:437
msgid "Choose language"
msgstr "Vælg sprog"

#: public/banner.php:458
msgid "Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information"
msgstr "Sælg eller del ikke mine personoplysninger"

