msgstr "https://plugins.lynbro.dk/lynbro-cookie-consent"

#. Description of the plugin
#: lynbro-cookie-consent.php
msgid ""
"Free, multilingual, fully configurable cookie consent banner — GDPR/ePrivacy"
" and Google Consent Mode v2 ready, with no pageview limits."
msgstr ""
"Gratis, flersproget og fuldt konfigurerbar cookie-samtykkebanner – klar til "
"GDPR/ePrivacy og Google Consent Mode v2, uden sidevisningsbegrænsninger."

#. Author of the plugin
#: lynbro-cookie-consent.php
msgid "Lynbro"
msgstr "Lynbro"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: lynbro-cookie-consent.php
msgid "https://lynbro.dk"
msgstr "https://lynbro.dk"

msgid "Remember the choice for (days)"
msgstr "Husk valget i (dage)"

msgid ""
"Accepting and rejecting are both remembered this long; after that the banner"
" asks again. 1 to 365 days, 365 by default."
msgstr ""
"Både accept og afvisning huskes i denne periode. Derefter spørger banneret "
"igen. 1 til 365 dage, 365 som standard."

